sequenceDiagram
    participant U as Assistant / caller
    participant C as API / control inbox
    participant H as Harness
    participant M as Model call
    participant D as Driver
    U->>C: Submit change and request_key
    C->>C: Persist ordered change and revision
    C-->>U: Acknowledge accepted, not applied
    C->>H: Notify control change
    alt Old work not dispatched
    H->>H: Revoke old eligibility; replan
    M-->>H: Late old reply: diagnostics only
    else Action already dispatched
    D-->>H: Return actual result; persist first
    H->>H: Close records before applying change
    end
    H->>M: Planner reads changes and valid progress
    M-->>H: Retain stage or revise plan
    H->>C: Record applied revision and plan
